    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;10.05</strong> Main presentation of Langerhans cell neoplasms</p>\r\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Sarah E. Coupland",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.65pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Langerhans cell histiocytosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Single system</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">One organ system involved</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Unifocal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Skin, bone,<sup>a</sup> subcutis, lymph node, and less frequently thyroid and pituitary stalk</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multifocal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Skin, bone<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Isolated pulmonary disease</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CNS<sup>c</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multisystem</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">More than two organ systems involved</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">With or without risk organ involvement<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Skin, bone,<sup>a</sup> lymph node, pituitary stalk, and less frequent involvement of gastrointestinal tract, thymus, or lungs</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.65pt; border: none; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Langerhans cell sarcoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; border: none; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Unifocal or locoregional</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Skin,<sup>d</sup> lymph node, and less frequently affecting lungs, bone, liver, spleen, gastrointestinal tract, bone marrow, or brain <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{25805533}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.65pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Advanced stage disseminated disease</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 297.65pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">a</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Osteolytic lesions presenting in the skull base and/or orbit-forming bones are designated as CNS-risk lesions. These lesions can be unifocal or part of multifocal bone or multisystem presentation <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{33157073}</span>. According to current standard treatment <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{23589673}</span>, systemic therapy is indicated for paediatric patients with single-system multifocal bone disease, multisystem disease, and isolated CNS-risk lesions to limit the risk of late effects&nbsp;/ permanent consequences including diabetes insipidus <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{30207064}</span> and neurodegenerative Langerhans cell histiocytosis <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{15049016;25689784;30421536;33157073}</span>. <sup>b</sup>Involvement of liver, spleen, or bone marrow, or a combination thereof, is associated with increased mortality risk <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{32106306;23589673}</span>. <sup>c</sup>Clinical neurodegeneration may present in the presence or absence of tumorous brain lesions <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{30421536}</span>. <sup>d</sup>Skin lesions affect underlying soft tissues <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">{32644218}</span>.</span></p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  }
